{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24928","headline":"赠毛仙翁 · 张仲方","name":"赠毛仙翁","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"毛仙翁，毛仙翁，容貌常如二八童。\n几岁头梳云鬓绿，无时面带桃花红。\n眼前人世阅沧海，肘後药成辞月宫。\n方口秀眉编贝齿，了然炅炅双瞳子。\n芝椿禀气本坚强，龟鹤计年应不死。\n四海五山长独游，矜贫傲富欺王侯。\n灵通指下甎甓化，瑞气炉中金玉流。\n定是烟霞列仙侣，暂来尘俗救危苦。\n紫霞妖女琼华飞，秘法虔心传付与。\n阴功足，阴功成，羽驾何年归上清。\n待我休官了婚嫁，桃源洞里觅仙兄。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张仲方","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_24928.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24928","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}